A glossy green icon in the [[frutiger-aero|Frutiger Aero]] style, with a soft gradient fill and a thick rounded outline. OpenDB uses it on the `{{stub}}` and `{{expand}}` templates, for entries and sections that should grow. A smaller copy is used on the site itself.
